[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 8881.51, "timestamp": "02:28:01", "text": "本当だ。 そうです。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8882.63, "timestamp": "02:28:02", "text": "どういう意味ですか？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8884.63, "timestamp": "02:28:04", "text": "中毒性はありません。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8885.349, "timestamp": "02:28:05", "text": "みんな、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8887.91, "timestamp": "02:28:07", "text": "私はただ、私はただ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8889.75, "timestamp": "02:28:09", "text": "毎朝プレイしただけで、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8891.83, "timestamp": "02:28:11", "text": "それは普通のことです。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8892.79, "timestamp": "02:28:12", "text": "カジュアルゲーマー。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8896.71, "timestamp": "02:28:16", "text": "私がそれを「脳の棒」と呼ぶのには理由があるのです。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8899.19, "timestamp": "02:28:19", "text": "おお。 あのね？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8902.55, "timestamp": "02:28:22", "text": "彼らが新しいレアリティのカテゴリをリリースするとき、それは脳腐病になるだろう。なぜなら今は"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8909.59, "timestamp": "02:28:29", "text": "SSRだから。  LRとかULとか、そんな感じになるまで待てよ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8917.67, "timestamp": "02:28:37", "text": "その時こそ、本当の頭脳労働が"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8918.95, "timestamp": "02:28:38", "text": "始まるのだ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8921.75, "timestamp": "02:28:41", "text": "それに、このゲームは"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8925.429, "timestamp": "02:28:45", "text": "平均的だと思うよ。 それはギャンブルのようなものだ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8927.75, "timestamp": "02:28:47", "text": "それはgaです。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8931.11, "timestamp": "02:28:51", "text": "いや、いや。 ほら、ジョージア州の件は、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8934.389, "timestamp": "02:28:54", "text": "ギャンブルだよね？ 私は"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8939.75, "timestamp": "02:28:59", "text": "うん。"}]